        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far away, on space colony Epsilon 13, Layla and her team were conducting interdimensional research. But when a portal tore open mid-experiment, the lab was flooded with hostile alien lifeforms. The systems failed, the lights went out, and the facility fell silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The data disks containing years of research have scattered across the maze-like facility — and Layla is the only one left to retrieve them. You’ll guide Layla through dangerous corridors, dodging and outmaneuvering alien patrols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the alien outbreak in <i>Infestation on Epsilon 13</i>, a game built on simple controls, fast-paced gameplay, and a focus on score chasing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic  maze action inspired by early arcade titles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical bonus round after each wave for big points</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives to start — earn extras every 5 waves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect disks, avoid enemies, and rack up a high score </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far away, on space colony Epsilon 13, Layla and her team were conducting interdimensional research. But when a portal tore open mid-experiment, the lab was flooded with hostile alien lifeforms. The systems failed, the lights went out, and the facility fell silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The data disks containing years of research have scattered across the maze-like facility — and Layla is the only one left to retrieve them. You’ll guide Layla through dangerous corridors, dodging and outmaneuvering alien patrols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the alien outbreak in <i>Infestation on Epsilon 13</i>, a game built on simple controls, fast-paced gameplay, and a focus on score chasing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic  maze action inspired by early arcade titles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical bonus round after each wave for big points</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives to start — earn extras every 5 waves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect disks, avoid enemies, and rack up a high score </p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Merciless alien lifeforms have overrun the laboratory on Epsilon 13. As Layla, collect the data disks scattered around the facility while avoiding the deadly enemies. Use your wits to outsmart these hostile extraterrestrials and go for the high score!",
